ink":"disney-vacation-club"}},"labels":{"linkText":"View Discounts","ariaLabel":"finder.discountsModal.labels.discounts.ariaLabel","title":"Discounts for"}},"schedule":{"scheduleGroupKeys":{"Operating":["Morning"]},"labels":{"pluralLabel":"Times","singularLabel":"Time","scheduleToLabel":"to","scheduleAndLabel":"and","emptySchedule":"No times available.","noPerformance":"No performance today","refurbishment":"No Times Available.","closedSchedule":"No Times Available.","extraMagicHour":"Extra Magic Hour","extraMagicHours":"finder.schedule.extraMagicHours","extraMagicHourMagicMorning":"Extra Magic Hour and Magic Morning","specialTicketedEvent":"Today's Special Ticketed Event","earlyEntry":"Early Entry","operating":"Operating Hours","extendedEvening":"finder.schedule.extendedEvening","performanceTime":"Today's Performance Time","performanceTimes":"Today's Performance Times","pageMessage":"is currently closed for refurbishment. Please check back here for updates.","modalLinkTitle":"View More Performance Times","modalLinkName":"View All Times","showtimesModalTitle":"Times for  Hungry Bear Barbecue Jamboree","hours":"Today's Hours","calendarAction":{"open":"Open Calendar","close":"Close Calendar","jump":"Jump to a specific date"},"calendarName":"Calendar","previousMonth":"finder.schedule.calendar.previousMonth","disabled":"finder.schedule.calendar.disabled","nextMonth":"finder.schedule.calendar.nextMonth"},"timeZone":"America/Los_Angeles","schedules":{"Operating":{"Morning":[{"date":"2026-10-26","startTime":"11:00:00","endTime":"20:00:00","startTimeOutput":"11:00 AM","endTimeOutput":"8:00 PM","group":"Morning"}]}},"scheduleTypeLinks":[{"type":"Early Entry","url":"/guest-services/early-admission-options/"},{"type":"Operating","url":"/calendars/day/"}]},"calendar":{"maxDays":42,"checkAvailabilityMaxDays":60,"maxAdditionalDays":10,"ctParkHoursMaxDays":42,"getMaxCalDaysFromService":false},"menuLink":{"text":"View Menu","href":"/dining/disneyland/hungry-bear-barbecue/menus/"},"actionButtonText":"","mealPeriodsData":{"labels":{"title":"Meal Periods","toLabel":"to","noSchedules":"There are no schedules available for the date selected.","defaultErrorMessage":"We were unable to check for available tables at this time. A problem occurred while looking for availability. Please try again later."}},"labels":{"waitTime":"finder.listing.dashPublic.waitTime"},"backgroundGradient":{"upperLeft":"#FFFAEB","lowerRight":"#F3FDFF"}},"storycards":{"data":[{"sections":[{"copy":["<p>After touring their stage acts around the greatest music halls in the United States—Henry, Wendell, Big Al and the rest of the Country Bears are showcasing their favorite regional barbecue dishes.</p><p>Picnic on a menu of delicious quick-service barbeque fare, tasty refreshments and delicious home-style desserts in the middle of the woods. Cross a wooden bridge and stroll through a pine forest to a rustic retreat, where an eager beaver statue welcomes you and your cubs with an all-important question: “Hungry?” We sure hope so!</p><p>Paw through the Barbecue Pulled Pork Sandwich, Smoked Beef Brisket Sandwich or Classic Cheeseburger. The Chicken Tenders and healthy snacks will surely satisfy your little ones.</p><p>If you’re truly ravenous, try our Smoked Barbecue Combo Platter featuring a selection of house-smoked meats, served with baked beans, coleslaw, white bread and pickled vegetables for a real humdinger of a meal! Those who prefer a plant-based meal can try the Corn Ribs Plate.</p><p>To wash it all down, try a specialty beverage like the Watermelon Lemonade.</p><p>Finally, some of the bear-y favorite items are desserts, made the old-fashioned way like the Funnel Cake Fries.</p>"],"key":"entityCard1","title":"The Country Bears Are Back"},{"copy":["<p>Relax by the Rivers of America and take time out to admire the peaceful waterfront view.</p><p>Surrounded by lush greenery, wave from the restaurant’s 2-story sprawling terrace as the <a href=\"/attractions/disneyland/mark-twain-riverboat/\">Mark Twain Riverboat</a>, <a href=\"/attractions/disneyland/sailing-ship-columbia/\">Sailing Ship Columbia</a> and <a href=\"/attractions/disneyland/davy-crocketts-explorer-canoes/\">Davy Crockett's Explorer Canoes</a> cruise by. Enjoy views of the <a href=\"/attractions/disneyland/pirates-lair-on-tom-sawyer-island/\">Pirate’s Lair on Tom Sawyer Island</a>—it’s a welcome escape while refueling for your next big adventure.</p><p>Your cubs will also love looking out for ducks waddling along the river shore, squirrels scampering about and other adorable woodland creatures!</p>"],"key":"entityCard2","title":"Paws for the Scenery"}]}]},"learnMore":[],"relatedActivities":{"title":"Related Activities","data":[{"copy":["It is highly recommended to plan ahead. For your convenience, order and pay with the Disneyland app."],"key":"entityCard3","title":"This Location Accepts Mobile Orders","link":"/guest-services/mobile-food-orders/","inlineDisplay":false,"image":{"desktop":"https://cdn1.parksmedia.wdprapps.disney.com/resize/mwImage/1/410/205/75/vision-dam/digital/parks-platform/parks-global-assets/disneyland/experience/friends/1019ZP_1365AS_JRoh-16x9.jpg?2023-11-21T14:55:28+00:00","mobile":"https://cdn1.parksmedia.wdprapps.disney.com/resize/mwImage/1/335/167/75/vision-dam/digital/parks-platform/parks-global-assets/disneyland/experience/friends/1019ZP_1365AS_JRoh-16x9.jpg?2023-11-21T14:55:28+00:00","media":"(max-width: 768px)","title":"","alt":"4 Guests looking at a phone screen while standing in Disneyland Park","thumbnail":"https://cdn1.parksmedia.wdprapps.disney.com/resize/mwImage/1/43/43/75/vision-dam/digital/parks-platform/parks-global-assets/disneyland/experience/friends/1019ZP_1365AS_JRoh-16x9.jpg?2023-11-21T14:55:28+00:00","metrics":{"desktop":{"width":410,"height":205},"mobile":{"width":335,"height":167},"thumb":{"width":43,"height":43}}}},{"copy":["Stroll along a musical marshland with unforgettable attractions, dining and shopping, in the forested home